### create a task
POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "assigned_project":1,
    "assigned_to":36,
    "title":"environment setup",
    "description":"set environment and collect all credentials",
    "priority":"Medium"
}

